# NVIDIA NIM (build.nvidia.com) — fill in your API key below.
# NVIDIA_MODEL is the process-wide default for provider "nvidia"; the other
# selectable models (config/providers.json "nvidia".models, fast -> advanced)
# live under this same provider/key and are picked per-request via the UI's
# model picker, not a separate env var or provider key.
